LAMMPS (8 Apr 2021)
units              lj
atom_style         full
neighbor           0.36 bin
neigh_modify       delay 200

pair_style         lj/cut 2.5

bond_style         fene
special_bonds    lj  0.0 1.0 1.0
read_data polymer_reversible.data
